Subject: [PATCH 05/19] feat(desktop): edit a G-series mouse's stored button
 bindings

A "Stored in the mouse" panel under the binding inspector, shown while
a stored profile is in control: profile tabs (and making a profile
active, switching it on first), every button of the stored profile with
what it does now and did originally, and for the opened button a choice
of mouse button, media key, firmware function (DPI, profiles, G-Shift,
tilt) or nothing. Save writes it into the mouse through the agent; the
answer is shown under the buttons. Stored macros are shown as their
keys (Ctrl + Tab).

Strings: a new [stored_profile] table, English in every locale for now.
