From: OpenLogi contributor <contributor@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:31:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/19] feat(desktop): stored DPI levels and starting DPI

While a stored profile is in control, the Pointer tab's DPI presets are
the profile's DPI levels and the DPI value is the level it starts at;
edits are written into the profile like the report rate. Before, DPI
changes only set the live DPI, which the mouse replaced with the stored
value on its next profile load (after a profile-list write, sleep or a
profile switch).
