From: OpenLogi contributor <contributor@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:34:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/19] feat(agent): devices and batteries in the Windows tray

The Windows notification-area icon said only "OpenLogi" and its menu
offered Open and Quit. Its tooltip now lists each device on its own
line with its battery (or Offline), and the menu shows the same rows,
greyed, above Open and Quit. The rows come from the platform-free tray
model the macOS menu already draws (now built on Windows too), so names
and order match the settings app; the tooltip refreshes on every change
the agent observes.
