From c22b3b199f3baf5cb1cbd943460bcd762c710866 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenLogi contributor <contributor@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:17:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/19] feat: user-set time on screen for the low-battery
 notice

Settings > General gets "Show the warning for (seconds)" under the
low-battery levels (2-600 s, 8 by default, every notice's time until
now). The notice board posts the low-battery notice for that long
(NoticeBoard::post_for); every other notice keeps NOTICE_LIFETIME.
