From 0d452ce5b32ac1cff0f543e07a8bbb5a32239ad0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenLogi contributor <contributor@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:50:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/19] feat: choose the display the low-battery notice appears
 on

Settings > General gets "Show notices on": the display with the
pointer (as before), the main display, or Display 1-4 by Windows'
numbering (\\.\DISPLAYn; a number with no display behind it falls back to
the main one). The choice travels to the overlay with the notices, like
the locale, and the Windows placement picks that monitor. macOS and
Linux keep their placement.

Wire: NoticeObservation::display appended (part of PROTOCOL_VERSION 47,
still unreleased); goldens updated.
